from .core import source as S, trip as T
R='Europe'
S('is-sportquest','Iceland',R,'https://www.sportquestholidays.com/destinations/iceland-fly-fishing/','Sportquest — Iceland fly-fishing programs','turn116368search32')
T('is-sportquest','West Rangá','Atlantic salmon;Brown trout','river','spring-fed salmon program','The operator lists West Rangá salmon and trout fishing in a spring-fed river.','Choose the salmon program or trout objective before comparing packages. Ask which beats are allocated to your party and whether tackle suitable for those beats is included; a lodge name alone does not establish how much water you will fish.')
T('is-sportquest','Vatnsdalsá','Atlantic salmon;Arctic char','river','northwestern river beats','The listed Vatnsdalsá program includes salmon and Arctic char.','Request the beat rotation, daily transport and division between species. Set aside space for two presentation systems only when the operator confirms that both objectives fit the booked days; do not buy a second outfit merely because the river has a mixed species list.')
T('is-sportquest','Mýrarkvísl','Brown trout;Atlantic salmon','river','small-river trout and salmon','The operator describes Mýrarkvísl as a tributary of Laxá í Aðaldal with trout and salmon.','Decide whether this is a trout-focused outing or a salmon booking. Ask about bank vegetation, casting space and the expected flies so that the rod you pack fits the actual reach rather than a generic Iceland packing list.')
T('is-sportquest','Reykjadalsá','Brown trout;Arctic char','river','dry-fly-focused river day','The listed Reykjadalsá trip emphasizes wild trout, char and dry-fly fishing.','Prioritize presentation and an agreed dry-fly selection over heavy salmon tackle. Ask for a practical alternative when surface activity is absent and whether changing beats is possible without consuming most of the fishing day.')
T('is-sportquest','Lónsá / Langanes','Brown trout;Arctic char','river','northeastern trout and char','The operator places Lónsá on Langanes and lists trout and Arctic char.','Treat the remoteness of the selected program as a transfer and resupply question. Confirm the meeting point, drying arrangements and spare-tackle availability before deciding which redundant items are worth carrying.')
S('no-fresh','Norway',R,'https://www.visitnorway.com/things-to-do/outdoor-activities/fishing/freshwater/','Visit Norway — freshwater fishing','turn116368search13',kind='tourism-board')
for place in ['Gaula','Orkla','Namsen']:
 T('no-fresh',place,'Atlantic salmon','river','salmon beat planning',f'Visit Norway identifies {place} among the salmon rivers of Trøndelag.',f'Build the {place} visit around an actual stretch of river and a named host. Compare the hours, bank access and beat rotation rather than treating every listing on the river as equivalent. Request the recommended line and presentation for your booked water before buying a salmon outfit.')
S('no-south','Norway',R,'https://www.visitnorway.com/things-to-do/outdoor-activities/fishing/','Visit Norway — fishing destinations','turn116368search1',kind='tourism-board')
T('no-south','Otra / Kristiansand','Atlantic salmon;Trout','river','southern Norway river visit','The tourism board identifies the Otra among the salmon and trout rivers near Kristiansand.','A short city-based visit needs a clearly identified fishing reach and a transfer plan. Ask the host which target is realistic for the allotted session; do not assume a river name guarantees access near your accommodation.')
S('se-visit','Sweden',R,'https://visitsweden.com/what-to-do/nature-outdoors/fishing/fishing-sweden/','Visit Sweden — fishing in Sweden','turn116368search2',kind='tourism-board')
T('se-visit','Swedish Lapland','Local targets to confirm','river','northern fly-fishing introduction','Visit Sweden describes fly-fishing opportunities in Swedish Lapland.','Select a named river and a base with the guide before arranging domestic transport. This is a regional discovery profile, not a claim that every stream is fishable. Ask the guide to narrow the target species, walking demands and equipment list before purchase.')
T('se-visit','High Coast','Pike;Sea trout','coast','mixed coastal fishing','Visit Sweden describes fresh- and saltwater fishing around the High Coast, including pike and sea trout.','Separate sheltered-water predator fishing from an exposed coastal outing. Ask which water and launch the guide intends to use, then choose clothing and tackle for that plan rather than bringing two complete kits for an unspecified mixed day.')
S('se-vattern','Sweden',R,'https://www.visitsmaland.se/en/discover/fishing-smaland/','Visit Småland — fishing','turn116368search26',kind='tourism-board')
T('se-vattern','Lake Vättern','Arctic char;Landlocked salmon;Pike','lake','large-lake species choice','Visit Småland lists char, landlocked salmon and pike in Vättern.','Choose one primary objective and a suitable boat or bank session. Ask the host to explain the depth and presentation intended for that target; the presence of several species is not a reason to assume one rod or method covers them all.')
S('fi-lakes','Finland',R,'https://www.visitfinland.com/en/articles/unique-fishing-locations-in-finland/','Visit Finland — fishing locations','turn116368search3',kind='tourism-board')
T('fi-lakes','Lake Saimaa','Pike;Perch;Zander','lake','reed margins versus open-water trolling','Visit Finland contrasts Saimaa trolling and reed-bed predator fishing.','Choose a trolling day or an active casting day before selecting rods. Ask how far the boat must travel and whether the guide supplies trolling equipment. A compact casting kit is more useful than buying downrigger equipment for a single hosted trip.')
T('fi-lakes','Lake Inari','Arctic char;Grayling;Lake trout','lake','northern-lake route planning','Visit Finland lists char, grayling and lake trout around Inari.','Ask which sheltered launch and fishing area suit the intended species and conditions. Distinguish a short guided session from a remote multi-day lake journey, especially when comparing boat time, overnight arrangements and the amount of spare equipment needed.')
S('dk-guide','Denmark',R,'https://denmarkfishinglodge.com/','Denmark Fishing Lodge — Fyn coastal sea trout','turn989051search17')
T('dk-guide','Helnæs / Fyn','Sea trout','coast','coastal fly and spinning day','The lodge describes guided coastal sea-trout fishing around Fyn and Helnæs.','Pick fly or spinning as the primary method, and ask how the guide selects a shore for the wind on the day. Pack a workable compact tackle selection and discuss footwear; do not turn a coastal day into an offshore-charter shopping list.')
S('dk-national','Denmark',R,'https://fishingindenmark.info/','Fishing in Denmark — regional angling information','turn989051search11',kind='tourism-angling-initiative')
T('dk-national','Mariager Fjord','Local targets to confirm','coast','fjord shore discovery','Fishing in Denmark includes Mariager Fjord as an angling destination.','Request a specific section of shore, target and entry point before treating this fjord overview as a finished plan. Use the source to find local detail; postpone species-specific tackle purchases until a local host confirms the intended session.')
T('dk-national','Little Belt','Local targets to confirm','coast','shore versus boat selection','The national angling initiative includes Little Belt and southern Jutland fishing.','Make the bank-versus-boat decision early. Ask the local provider what water conditions and method the outing is designed for, then confirm which equipment is supplied. A general coastal recommendation is not an instruction to fish a shipping channel independently.')
S('ie-if','Ireland',R,'https://fishinginireland.info/','Inland Fisheries Ireland — angling reports and destinations','turn989051search1',kind='fisheries-agency')
T('ie-if','Lough Corrib','Brown trout','lake','trout day with a local boatman','Inland Fisheries Ireland reports Corrib trout and mayfly fishing.','A current local report is more useful than a fixed annual hatch promise. Ask whether the planned session is drift fishing, another boat technique or shore access. Agree the flies and rod setup with the boatman rather than buying a national assortment.')
T('ie-if','River Shannon','Pike;Trout','riverboat','choose the reach before the species list','The agency covers pike and trout angling in the Shannon system.','Choose a bounded reach and one primary target. Distances and tackle needs depend on that decision; a river-wide species list cannot specify the best launch, depth or method. Compare guiding offers by the actual stretch covered and the time spent fishing.')
S('ie-guide','Ireland',R,'https://fishing.ie/','Fishing.ie — local guides and western lakes','turn989051search5')
for p in ['Lough Conn','Lough Mask','Lough Carra']:
 T('ie-guide',p,'Brown trout','lake','western lough boat session',f'The local guide information lists {p} among its western trout waters.',f'Ask which part of {p} the boatman expects to fish and what the weather alternative is. Decide whether you need to carry your own rods and flies or can use a supplied setup. Keep waterproof storage accessible because a boat day differs from a roadside river session.')
S('uk-alba','United Kingdom',R,'https://albagamefishing.com/','Alba Game Fishing — Scottish guided waters','turn989051search15')
for p in ['River Tweed','River Tay','River Spey','River Dee']:
 T('uk-alba',p,'Atlantic salmon','river','Scottish salmon beat visit',f'Alba lists guided salmon fishing on the {p}.',f'Compare {p} offers at beat level: host, bank allocation, session length and equipment provision. Ask whether the day is intended as instruction or independent fishing with assistance. Avoid buying a specialized rod until the host confirms the preferred presentation for the allocated water.')
S('uk-kennet','United Kingdom',R,'https://www.aardvarkmcleod.com/destinations/','Aardvark McLeod — Barton Court on the Kennet','turn702116view0','text-inspected')
T('uk-kennet','Barton Court / River Kennet','Trout','spring','chalkstream day-trip planning','The operator lists Barton Court fishing on the Kennet near Hungerford.','Plan a specific estate-water day rather than general public-river access. Ask the host what presentation, footwear and casting space to expect. An economical choice is an appropriate existing trout outfit with the small local fly selection confirmed in advance.')
S('uk-wales','United Kingdom',R,'https://www.visitwales.com/','Visit Wales — freshwater fishing places','turn989051search3',kind='tourism-board')
T('uk-wales','Llyn Y Gors / Anglesey','Coarse fish','lakebank','managed fishery introduction','Visit Wales includes Llyn Y Gors as a coarse-fishing venue on Anglesey.','Ask the fishery which lake fits a beginner, the preferred target and the available hire equipment. Select the session first; a managed coarse-fishing visit does not automatically need mountain-walking equipment or a coastal sea-fishing rod.')
S('nl-urban','Netherlands',R,'https://www.ufxfishing.com/','UFX Fishing — Amsterdam guided predator fishing','turn974316search17')
T('nl-urban','Amsterdam canals and IJ','Pike;Perch;Zander','urban','city predator-fishing session','The guide offers Amsterdam canal and IJ fishing for pike, perch and zander.','Choose street fishing or a guided boat session before estimating walking, tackle and luggage needs. Ask the guide whether a portable loan outfit is available. Keep the plan tied to an actual meeting point and session instead of assuming every canal bank is suitable.')
S('nl-fries','Netherlands',R,'https://fishingbooker.com/charters/view/35913','Operator listing — Friesland lake fishing','turn974316search13',kind='operator-listing')
T('nl-fries','Sneekermeer / Friesland','Pike;Perch;Zander','lake','Friesland predator boat trip','The operator listing includes Sneekermeer in its Friesland fishing area and lists pike, perch and zander.','Ask which lake is proposed for the booked day; the operator may use several waters. Prioritize boat arrangement, target and included tackle over a fixed lake claim. A quoted fishing area is not confirmation of a specific launch or daily availability.')
S('be-ourthe','Belgium',R,'https://visitwallonia.com/en-gb/content/ourthe-valley-and-riveo-fishing-paradise-wallonia','Visit Wallonia — Ourthe and RIVEO','turn974316search7',kind='tourism-board')
T('be-ourthe','Ourthe Valley / RIVEO','Local targets to confirm','river','guided angling instruction','Visit Wallonia describes fishing activities and instruction through RIVEO in the Ourthe Valley.','Book by the skill you want to learn and the water used for that lesson. Ask what tackle is included and which method the instructor will teach. A first lesson should not require buying an entire fly or coarse-fishing setup in advance.')
S('be-federation','Belgium',R,'https://www.maisondelapeche.be/en/peche-de-jour','Maison de la Pêche — Walloon fishing waters','turn974316search18',kind='fisheries-organization')
for p,k in [('Nisramont Lake','lakebank'),('Semois / Herbeumont','river'),("Eau d’Heure Lakes",'lakebank')]:
 T('be-federation',p,'Local targets to confirm',k,'access-first freshwater outing',f'The Walloon fishing organization includes {p} in its fishing-water information.',f'Use the listed water to arrange a specific {p} outing, not to infer a species or season. Confirm the bank, target and method with the water manager or a local guide. Build the shopping list only after that choice, starting with equipment you already own.')
S('lu-sure','Luxembourg',R,'https://www.visitluxembourg.com/place/fishing-in-the-s-re','Visit Luxembourg — fishing the Sûre','turn974316search8',kind='tourism-board')
T('lu-sure','Sûre River','Local targets to confirm','river','small-country river day','The national tourism site has a dedicated Sûre fishing listing.','Identify the exact river section and arrange local tackle guidance before arrival. Do not apply a country-wide species list to the selected reach. A compact day plan should include the meeting point, bank accessibility and somewhere to store wet equipment afterward.')
S('lu-border','Luxembourg',R,'https://guichet.public.lu/en/citoyens/loisirs/permis-licences/peche/permis-peche-eaux-frontalieres-allemagne.html','Guichet Luxembourg — named border fishing waters','turn974316search23',kind='public-agency')
T('lu-border','Moselle / Wasserbillig','Local targets to confirm','river','border-river bank planning','The public information identifies the Moselle fishing reach between Schengen and Wasserbillig.','Use Wasserbillig as a planning base, then confirm the actual bank and target with a local source. Shared water does not make every bank equivalent. Choose tackle for the agreed method and leave the larger fish-species shortlist unresolved until that is known.')
T('lu-border','Vianden reservoir / Our','Local targets to confirm','lakebank','reservoir day-trip research','The public source includes the Our and Vianden reservoir among the named fishing waters.','Confirm the specific reservoir access and intended method before buying terminal tackle. Treat the town visit, shoreline walk and fishing session as separate parts of the day, and ask where a local beginner can obtain practical instruction.')
S('de-muritz','Germany',R,'https://www.mueritzfischer.de/','Müritzfischer — waters and guided fishing','turn155870search0',kind='fishery-manager')
T('de-muritz','Lake Müritz','Pike;Perch;Zander','lake','large-lake guided predators','Müritzfischer offers fishing services and lists pike, perch and zander in its lake-fishing information.','Compare a guided boat with a self-run rental according to your experience. Ask which presentation and target suit the selected area rather than packing everything. Establish the launch, fuel and included equipment before calculating the total day cost.')
S('at-official','Austria',R,'https://www.austria.info/en-us/activities/fishing/','Austria Tourism — fishing destinations','turn719008search1',kind='tourism-board')
T('at-official','Ybbs / Mostviertel','Local targets to confirm','river','Austrian river fly-fishing','Austria Tourism identifies the Ybbs in Mostviertel among its fishing destinations.','Choose the hosted reach first and ask what technique is intended there. Keep the trip as a river-specific plan rather than assuming the equipment and access of another Austrian valley apply. Agree the daily start point before selecting accommodation.')
T('at-official','Lünersee / Rätikon','Local targets to confirm','alpine','high-country lake outing','Austria Tourism includes Lünersee in the Rätikon as a fishing destination.','Coordinate mountain access and fishing time before picking rod length or lure quantities. Ask about the actual shoreline route and return transport. Pack one agreed approach instead of a heavy mixed tackle collection that compromises the walk.')
T('at-official','Formarinsee / Arlberg','Local targets to confirm','alpine','mountain-lake day planning','The tourism board lists Formarinsee near Arlberg as a fishing destination.','Separate the scenic lake visit from confirmation of the fishing session. Establish how much walking is involved, the available shoreline and the host’s recommended target. A portable setup and a deliberately small tackle selection are preferable to unplanned equipment weight.')
S('at-traun','Austria',R,'https://dachstein.salzkammergut.at/en/oesterreich-poi/detail/201048/fishing-in-the-goiserer-traun-river.html','Dachstein Salzkammergut — Goiserer Traun','turn719008search27',kind='tourism-board')
T('at-traun','Goiserer Traun','Brown trout','river','bounded fly-fishing reach','The regional tourism listing describes brown-trout fly fishing on the Goiserer Traun.','Ask for the exact included stretch and available instruction. The useful tackle decision is the presentation for those pools, not the most powerful rod in a trout catalog. Confirm the wading plan and whether bank-only fishing is possible for your party.')
S('at-seevilla','Austria',R,'https://www.seevilla.at/en/fishing-fly-fishing.html','Seevilla — Ausseerland fishing waters','turn719008search19')
T('at-seevilla','Grundlsee','Pike','lake','lake predator session','Seevilla’s fishing information includes pike fishing at Grundlsee.','Treat the lake-predator outing as a separate kit from neighboring trout streams. Ask whether the fishing is boat-based and whether larger lures and landing equipment are supplied. Avoid bringing an unsuitable light trout outfit simply because both trips are in the same holiday region.')
S('mc-operator','Monaco',R,'https://yfspecialist.com/french-riviera-fishing-offers-city-monaco','YF Specialist — Monaco fishing departures','turn719008search7')
T('mc-operator','Monaco offshore','Bluefin tuna;Swordfish','offshore','Riviera offshore charter','The operator advertises Monaco departures targeting tuna and swordfish with offshore methods.','Specify the target and method when requesting the trip. A daytime tuna session and a swordfish outing have different schedules and expectations. Confirm heavy equipment provision before buying specialist tackle; the priority is a clearly described charter rather than a generic boat rental.')
T('mc-operator','Monaco coastal night fishing','Squid;Barracuda;Mackerel','reef','evening light-tackle outing','The operator lists night inshore fishing for squid, barracuda and mackerel from Monaco.','Ask how long the outing runs after dark and what lighting and tackle are supplied. Keep this compact evening trip separate from offshore big-game preparation. Confirm the return point and clothing needs rather than assuming a warm afternoon means a comfortable night boat ride.')
S('fr-re','France',R,'https://www.iledere.com/en/organizing-activities-and-leisure/guided-sea-outings/sea-fishing/','Île de Ré Tourism — guided sea fishing','turn719008search28',kind='tourism-board')
T('fr-re','Île de Ré','Local targets to confirm','coast','guided coastal lure session','The tourism board describes guided sea-fishing and lure-fishing outings around Île de Ré.','Choose the small-boat coastal lesson or larger offshore program explicitly. Ask what species and tackle are intended for the particular outing rather than assuming all advertised methods run together. Match the session length to the non-fishing members of your party.')
S('fr-var','France',R,'https://www.visitvar.com/what-to-do/water-activities/sea-fishing','Visit Var — sea fishing','turn719008search24',kind='tourism-board')
T('fr-var','Var coast','Local targets to confirm','coast','shore versus guided boat day','Visit Var describes both shore and boat sea-fishing activities along its coastline.','Pick a named departure port and a clear technique before comparing offers. A broad coast page is a starting point, not confirmation of fishing next to your hotel. Ask the operator which portable items you should bring and which fishing equipment is included.')
S('es-leon','Spain',R,'https://www.aardvarkmcleod.com/destinations/','Aardvark McLeod — León fly fishing','turn702116view0','text-inspected')
T('es-leon','Cistierna / León','Brown trout','river','Cantabrian trout program','The operator describes a Cistierna-based program for brown trout in northern León.','Use the base to compare actual fishing days and transfers, not just hotel quality. Ask which water and presentation are appropriate for your skill level. Keep the fly box focused on the guide’s short list, and confirm whether equipment can be borrowed for instruction.')
S('pt-official','Portugal',R,'https://www.visitportugal.com/en/content/azores-fishing','Visit Portugal — Azores Fishing operator listing','turn952426search1',kind='tourism-board')
T('pt-official','Ponta Delgada / São Miguel','Local targets to confirm','offshore','Azores charter discovery','The national tourism listing locates an Azores fishing operator at Ponta Delgada marina.','Select the target and trip duration with the listed provider before using this as an offshore plan. Establish the departure marina, equipment inclusions and weather alternative. The listing confirms an operator contact, not a species forecast or a confirmed seat.')
S('it-trentino','Italy',R,'https://www.trentinofishing.it/','Trentino Fishing — managed fishing waters','turn952426search7',kind='tourism-fisheries-organization')
for p in ['Sarca / Regorie','Chiese / Val di Fumo','Avisio / CK reach','Adige / NKC reach']:
 T('it-trentino',p,'Local targets to confirm','river','Trentino reach-specific fishing',f'Trentino Fishing identifies {p} in its named fishing-water system.',f'Plan the {p} outing around the exact reach shown by the local fishery rather than a river-wide assumption. Ask what method and target fit that water, whether instruction is available, and what equipment can be supplied. Do not purchase a complete trout kit until those details are confirmed.')
S('it-sesia','Italy',R,'https://www.valsesiapesca.it/','Valsesia Pesca — Sesia fishing reserves','turn952426search11',kind='fishery-manager')
T('it-sesia','Sesia / Varallo','Local targets to confirm','river','reserve-based river session','Valsesia Pesca lists Varallo-area fishing reserves on the Sesia.','Compare the exact reserve and the permitted fishing style when arranging a guide. Keep the requested target separate from assumptions about the whole river. Ask for the local presentation and wading conditions before choosing footwear and a rod to travel with.')
T('it-sesia','Sesia / Alagna','Local targets to confirm','river','upper-valley fishing visit','The fishery organization includes Alagna among its managed Sesia fishing locations.','Treat this upper-valley visit as its own reach-specific plan instead of copying the Varallo checklist. Confirm the walking, river entry and technique with the host. Pack only the agreed tackle and protect a dry change of clothes for the onward journey.')
S('ee-ice','Estonia',R,'https://visitestonia.com/en/mesi-tare-winter-day-on-lake-peipsi','Visit Estonia — Mesi Tare Peipsi winter fishing','turn755425search8',kind='tourism-board')
T('ee-ice','Lake Peipsi / Varnja winter','Local targets to confirm','ice','hosted ice-fishing day','The tourism board lists a hosted winter fishing experience from Varnja on Lake Peipsi.','Book the hosted experience rather than treating a published winter activity as approval to go onto ice alone. Ask what insulated equipment and shelter are included and how the operator makes the day-of decision. Do not buy an auger before learning what the host supplies.')
S('ee-boat','Estonia',R,'https://visitestonia.com/en/boat-rental-in-varnja','Visit Estonia — Varnja fishing-boat rental','turn755425search24',kind='tourism-board')
T('ee-boat','Lake Peipsi / Varnja open water','Local targets to confirm','lake','open-water rental or guided day','Visit Estonia lists fishing-boat rental at Varnja on Lake Peipsi.','An open-water boat outing is a separate plan from the winter experience. Ask for the target, route and required boat experience before booking a rental. Confirm flotation, communications and equipment provision instead of assuming a rental includes a guide or fishing tackle.')
S('lv-official','Latvia',R,'https://www.latvia.travel/en/fishing-latvia','Latvia Travel — fishing destinations','turn755425search1',kind='tourism-board')
T('lv-official','Lake Burtnieks','Local targets to confirm','lake','Valmiera-area lake trip','Latvia Travel highlights Lake Burtnieks in its fishing information.','Ask a local host to narrow the target and boat route before choosing tackle. A broad lake entry is useful for finding a base, but cannot specify the best daily method. Compare the complete guided day, including travel, with the actual costs of a self-run rental.')
S('lv-guide','Latvia',R,'https://www.fishingguidelatvia.com/fishing-in-latvia-acomprehensive-guide/','Fishing Guide Latvia — waters and methods','turn755425search13')
T('lv-guide','Lake Usma','Pike;Perch','lake','lake predator casting','The local guide names Usma among Latvian pike and perch lakes.','Specify pike or perch as the main objective and ask the guide to provide appropriate lure sizes. Pack a casting outfit matched to that presentation, not an indiscriminate bait kit. Confirm boat space and whether a spare setup is supplied before bringing multiple rods.')
T('lv-guide','Lake Lubāns','Pike;Perch','lake','guided freshwater predator day','The guide includes Lubāns among its Latvian predator-fishing waters.','Plan the launch and sheltered alternative with a local host. Ask how much of the day is spent moving between areas and whether tackle is included. The lake name should help organize an actual outing, not imply identical conditions throughout the waterbody.')
S('pl-guide','Poland',R,'https://guidedfishing.eu/wielkie-jeziora-mazurskie-wyprawy-z-przewodnikiem-wedkarskim/','Guided Fishing Poland — Masurian lake programs','turn755425search7')
for p in ['Lake Mamry','Lake Śniardwy','Lake Niegocin']:
 T('pl-guide',p,'Pike;Perch','lake','Masurian guided predator fishing',f'The operator lists {p} in its Masurian pike and perch program.',f'Ask whether {p} is the planned water for your date or one option within a mobile guiding area. Match accommodation to the confirmed launch, not just the region. Select lure sizes and rod power after the operator narrows the main target and confirms supplied equipment.')
